[382.157808, "o", "The retained configuration is the depth-5 XGBoost baseline and `pairmax` selection: exhaustively choose the highest summed-score singleton or pair of mutually jet-disjoint triplets, with at most two candidates per event and no score threshold. No threshold was used because triplet-level recall is the specified primary target. The held-out collection has {sel['selected_triplets']} selected candidates in {sel['inference_events']} events; all jet-overlap and multiplicity constraints were explicitly checked.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[382.157849, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[382.157888, "o", "> "]
[382.158017, "o", "## Optimization iterations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
